{"sections":[{"slug":"杠消解","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"杠消解"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">杠消解</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"杠消解"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">杠消解</span></strong> (bar resolution) <span lang=\"zh\">指的是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/杠构造","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">杠构造</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">所得的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">或链复形</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Dold–Kan对应","text":"Dold–Kan <span lang=\"zh\">对应</span>"}},{"Plain":").</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">群的逆环路空间</span></h3>\n<p>todo</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The free abelian group on the nerve (of $BG$) is a simplicial abelian group; applying the Dold-Kan correspondence to it produces the bar resolution.</p>\n<p>Qiaochu Yuan, <span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://math.stackexchange.com/q/3842817\" title=\"MSE 问题下的评论 [https://math.stackexchange.com/q/3842817]\">MSE <span lang=\"zh\">问题下的评论</span></a></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为群</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">所谓杠消解</span> (bar resolution) <span lang=\"zh\">是指</span> $\\mathbb{Z}$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $\\mathbb{Z}[G]$-<span lang=\"zh\">模的一个自由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/消解","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">消解</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">它可用于计算</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出函子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\operatorname{Ext}^\\bullet_{\\mathbb{Z}[G]}(\\mathbb{Z},-)$, <span lang=\"zh\">也即</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":" $H^\\bullet(G,-)$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A,B$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/幺半范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">幺半范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">有同态</span> $f\\colon B\\to A$, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $B$-<span lang=\"zh\">双模中的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">结合代数</span>"}},{"Plain":",\n$$\r\nA\\otimes_B A \\rightrightarrows A\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}